 a bone morphogenetic protein (BMP) coreceptor (PubMed:18976966). Through enhancement of BMP signaling regulates hepcidin (HAMP) expression and regulates iron homeostasis (PubMed:18976966)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}